WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.314
Week 14: Travel, Transport, and Lodging. reserve transport and lodging check in report delays and room problems

2
00:00:08.314 --> 00:00:29.500
Read for the situation. El vuelo de Omar llega tarde y pierde el último autobús. Llama al hotel para mantener la reserva y pregunta cómo llegar en transporte compartido. Omar's flight arrives late, and he misses the last bus. He calls the hotel to keep the reservation and asks how to get there using shared transportation.

3
