Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:54.122 --> 00:01:20.551
Model language. El vuelo de Omar llega tarde. — Omar's flight arrives late. Pierde el último autobús. — He misses the last bus. Llama al hotel para conservar la reserva. — He calls the hotel to keep the reservation. Pregunta por el transporte compartido. — He asks about shared transport. El hotel confirma la reserva. — The hotel confirms the reservation.

7
